{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor","text":"MXLColor"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLRoot\/Step-swift.struct\/color"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLColor"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLRootV4StepV5colorAA8MXLColorVSgvp","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","title":"color"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlroot\/step-swift.struct\/color"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLRoot","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLRoot\/Step-swift.struct"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLRoot/Step-swift.struct":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLRoot\/Step-swift.struct","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Step","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The root-step type represents the pitch step of the root of the current chord within the harmony element. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"text attribute